      "content": "that makes sense, thanks. i also read something in a study about patient management and how there's different 'norms' for different groups. for example, when it comes to pain management or assessing severity, do nurses or doctors tend to approach patients of different races differently? like, is there a difference in how we're supposed to gauge pain levels or sensitivity in black patients vs white patients based on clinical guidelines?",
